@startuml Linkwise_Software_Layers
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 25
top to bottom direction
actor "ChatGPT Agent / Codex\nexternal orchestrating agent" as AI
package "Linkwise trusted application boundary" {
 rectangle "MCP inbound adapter\nidentity / schema / results" as MCP
 rectangle "Application services\nstation execution / queries\ncollection / operation records" as APP
 rectangle "Domain core\npolicy / leases / session invariants\neligibility / ranking / evidence" as CORE
 rectangle "Typed outbound ports\ncapabilities / observations\nbounded control requests" as PORTS
 MCP -right-> APP
 APP --> CORE : pure domain decisions
 APP --> PORTS : typed use cases
}
rectangle "Infrastructure adapters\nHamlib / qualified PTT / audio\nnative modem / VARA / Winlink\nevidence / persistence / simulation" as ADAPTERS
rectangle "Radio hardware" as HW
rectangle "External services\nand local repositories" as EXT
rectangle "Independent emergency stop\nand watchdog release" as STOP
AI --> MCP : typed mediated tools
PORTS <|.. ADAPTERS
ADAPTERS --> HW
ADAPTERS --> EXT
STOP --> HW : inhibit / release
note bottom of CORE
 The agent chooses strategy; local policy enforces authority.
 Domain decisions do not depend on devices or model vendors.
end note
@enduml
